cycle Incident Response Loop

center RESPOND
autonumber

tag Owner as o
  On-call blue
  Platform green
  Security purple
  Comms orange

Detect o: On-call
  Alert fires and the pager goes off
Triage o: On-call
  Size the blast radius and pick a severity
  -Page the owners->
Contain o: Security
  Isolate the affected hosts
Fix o: Platform
  Ship the patch or roll back
Communicate red o: Comms
  Status page and customer notes
Review o: On-call
  Blameless write-up, then new alerts
